{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_312439147#0_676214884","relevance":1,"reason":"This is a university master's degree program description. It mentions learning tools to coach and influence team performance, but it is not dedicated to answering how coaches can improve team performance and gives little direct actionable evidence.","learned":"Degree-program pages often mention coaching team performance but are not useful as direct evidence."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"improve team performance\" coach (+ communication motivation \"goal setting\"))","reason":"Search for documents that directly discuss improving team performance and include concrete coaching actions such as communication, motivation, and goal setting."}}
