{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3380"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_08_1063304173#3_1897727929","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3380","rank":2,"snippet":"from our Global team of coaches, facilitators and project managers who are all passionate about making a positive difference through coaching and transformation. The team spans all continents, bringing experience of all industries and levels of seniority and has multilingual delivery capability. The home of performance coaching Performance coaching raises performance in individuals, teams and organizations. We offer individual executive coaching (1:1) and Coaching for Performance training for people in organizations to help them fulfil their potential. As individuals flourish, company performance <cover>improves. Performance coaching helps sustainable improvement and growth because it engages hearts as well as minds. Workplace coaching, leadership development and transformation We provide a unique blend of capabilities and integrated services for individual, team and organizational development: Public coach training courses – open-access courses for individuals pursuing coach certification, and transformational leadership skills; Leadership development – creating outstanding leaders through off-the-shelf or tailored in-house training and executive coaching. Team development – raising team performance </cover>through team coaching;\" , \"start_char\": 2340.000000 , \"title\": \"What Is Performance Coaching & Leadership Development\" , \"url\": \"http://www.performanceconsultants.com/about-us\" }"}}
